@lrf=1|aud=LLM|scope=demucs-admission
R|admission.feeder|task:demucs-admission|MUST|LW_SCOPE|Feeder obtains explicit downstream-track ticket (default capacity one); pre-handoff OS RAM plus required GPU/shared-memory safety observation required; park exhausted ticket durably without holding worker.
R|admission.budget|task:demucs-admission|MUST|LW_SCOPE|Distinguish permanent per-task budget excess from transient resource pressure; permanent excess=terminal reason, no loop; unknown telemetry=fail closed; avoid uint64 overflow and double-counting OS RAM/existing reservations/observed shared GPU.
R|admission.lifecycle|task:demucs-admission|MUST|LW_SCOPE|Hold one idempotently released ticket through wavefront join, GPU cleanup, SHM/related cache cleanup on success/failure/timeout/cancellation/MixOnly.
R|admission.parallelism|task:demucs-admission|MUST|LW_SCOPE|Use existing long-track CPU parallelism=1 and Disk fallback before rejecting large task; preserve stem-level parallelism, DB lane/schema behavior, Demucs single execution; no automatic DB-to-single-file lane transfer.
R|admission.accounting|task:demucs-admission|MUST|LW_SCOPE|Estimate by task duration/file capacity, active analysis stem count, planned CPU consumers, GPU working set, and a shared-GPU host-RAM safety reserve; GlobalMemoryStatusEx.AvailPhys already reflects current shared-GPU use; do not subtract it twice; re-observe immediately before worker handoff.
